    EASE bounce

  ANIMATE cardActions SCALE TO 1.08
    DURATION 0.4s
    EASE bounce

  ANIMATE cardProjects SCALE TO 1.08
    DURATION 0.4s
    EASE bounce

  ANIMATE cardCopilot SCALE TO 1.08
    DURATION 0.4s
